WEBVTT

00:04:59.045 --> 00:05:05.718
that imposes a hardship on customers,
on employees, on communities,

00:05:05.718 --> 00:05:08.095
on your 401(k).

00:05:09.930 --> 00:05:13.768
My family wasn't allowed to set foot
in a Walmart for a generation,

00:05:13.809 --> 00:05:16.896
after Walmart put my granddaddy's
general store out of business,

00:05:16.896 --> 00:05:18.064
so I get it.

00:05:18.856 --> 00:05:24.779
At the same time, failure is the fate
of nearly every company,

00:05:24.779 --> 00:05:27.323
and that is why capitalism works.

00:05:27.615 --> 00:05:30.034
Imagine, if you will,
when a company fails,